- Remove unsupported percentage-reduction guarantees.
- Show actual input and output sizes.
- Show actual percentage saved.
- Warn when the output becomes larger.
- Provide a cancellation mechanism when practical.
- Handle very large documents safely.
- Avoid unnecessary memory duplication.
- Preserve orientation and page dimensions.
- Verify the output PDF can be reopened.
- Handle encrypted or unsupported PDFs honestly.

